158
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:59,600
Me läheme tagasi.

159
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:59,600
tagasi Corvette'i juurde.

160
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:03,280
Sest see ei ole enam.

161
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:03,280
mingi maalähi odav auto.

162
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:06,600
Sellel on vedrustus.

163
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:06,600
valmistatud süsinikkiust.

164
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:11,480
Selle istmete raamid on valmistatud

165
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:11,480
Valmistatud ülimalt kergest magneesiumist.

166
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:13,480
Sellel on erinevad sõidurežiimid.

167
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:13,480
sõidurežiime.

168
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:15,440
nagu Ferraris.

169
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:19,640
Ja see suur, valju V8...

170
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:19,640
saab välja lülitada.

171
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:19,640
poole oma silindritest.

172
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:21,920
et muuta see säästlikumaks.

173
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:28,280
Eelmisel Corvette'i mudelil oli alusplaat.

174
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:28,280
olid tegelikult päris lähedal.

175
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:28,280
nii palju kui võimalik.

176
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:34,400
Aga see on täiesti uus.

177
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:34,400
kõrgetasemeline, kokku pandud mudel.


178
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:34,400
alumiiniumist valmistatud konstruktsioon.

179
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:37,120
mis suudab olla

180
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:37,120
kergem ja jäigem.

181
00:06:38,520 --> 00:06:40,040
Parim on see, et see on välja töötatud...

182
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:43,040
Nürburgringi ringrajal.

183
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:43,040
mitte Nagvilis.

184
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:45,920
See tähendab, et

185
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:45,920
kurvides on...

186
00:06:45,960 --> 00:06:48,000
Noh, see on üsna eriline kogemus.

187
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:49,800
(rehvid hõikavad)

188
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:58,640
Kogu see jõud…

189
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:58,640
kogu see suurus,

190
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:00,960
aga see on ikkagi...

191
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:00,960
põhimõtteliselt kontrollitav.

192
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:06,040
Kas sa mäletad, kui sul oli...

193
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:06,040
Kas sa mäletad, kui sa lapsena elevanti lemmikloomana olid?

194
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:07,320
See on selline.

195
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:11,240
See on "Sweet Home Alabama".

196
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:13,360
See on nagu tüdrukud, kes kannavad teksist lühikesi pükse.

197
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:23,000
Jah! See on kõik.

198
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:23,000
Ma tahtsin, et see nii oleks.

199
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:28,440
Aga see on midagi enamat.

200
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:28,440
See on võrdne Euroopa autode tasemega.

201
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:34,320
Olgu me selge, et...

202
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:34,320
see pole nii, et Corvette oleks…

203
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:34,320
See pole ka nii, et see oleks kaotanud kogu oma lihtsameelsuse.

204
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:36,840
Kui Porsche on nagu laboratoorium,

205
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:36,840
täis laserkiiri,

206
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:39,280
see on nagu Lääne-Ameerika saloon.

207
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:44,920
Aga sa ei pea seda ütlema.

208
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:44,920
et selle pärast vabandust paluda.

209
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:47,120
Sa ei pea seda ütlema.

210
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:47,120
"No vähemalt see on odav."

211
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:48,680
Või siis: "See on parim..."

212
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:48,680
nad suudavad teha."

213
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:51,120
See on lihtsalt hea.

214
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:57,400
Tegelikult on see...

215
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:57,400
parim sportauto kunagi.

216
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:57,400
...et selline auto peaks Ameerikast tulema.

217
00:07:57,440 --> 00:08:01,040
Ja seekord ei saa sa seda öelda.

218
00:07:57,440 --> 00:08:01,040
ja nüüd sa saad sellega kaasneda naljaga.

219
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:10,520
See on hea auto.

220
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:13,520
See on tüütav.

221
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:18,600
See on tüütu, sest...

222
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:18,600
teist korda.

223
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:18,600
selle sarja.

224
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,720
Ma olen sinuga nõus...

225
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,720
Tegelikult, teisel korral.

226
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,720
minu elus, ma olen sinuga nõus.

227
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:24,400
Mis, kas sa ei kavatse...

228
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:24,400
- minu nimi on Billy Bob Hammond.

229
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:24,400
kas sa oled?

230
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:27,080
-Ei, ja ma ei kavatse seda ka.

231
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:27,080
Ükskõik, ma ei maini seda jakki.

232
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:27,080
Kas sa ei ole?

233
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:29,280
Ei, ma tean, ma tean.

234
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:29,280
sa tahad, et ma seda teeksin.

235
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:29,280
aga ma ei kavatse seda teha.

236
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:31,600
Te teate, ma kavatsen...

237
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:31,600
ma tegelikult teen.

238
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:31,600
ja ma küsin sulle seda.


239
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:34,520
Millest neist kahest?

240
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:34,520
millist neist sa valiks?

241
00:08:34,560 --> 00:08:37,160
Ah, näete, asi on selles, et...

242
00:08:34,560 --> 00:08:37,160
tegelikult üsna raske.

243
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:39,640
- sest mõlemad on...

244
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:39,640
– seda on väga raske öelda.

245
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:39,640
-Need on tõesti nii.

246
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:44,120
Nüüd sellega pole midagi vaielda.

247
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:44,120
Aga ma ei tea, ma ei usu…

248
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:44,120
Porsche näeb väga hea välja.

