977
00:28:47,040 --> 00:28:49,040
Jah!

978
00:28:49,080 --> 00:28:50,800
Nii oleks meilgi.

979
00:28:50,840 --> 00:28:53,320
Nii ka Porsche.

980
00:28:50,840 --> 00:28:53,320
Aga meil on probleem.

981
00:28:53,360 --> 00:28:58,080
McLaren on öelnud, et me ei saa seda teha.

982
00:28:53,360 --> 00:28:58,080
aga me ei saa seda testi meie radal teha.

983
00:28:58,120 --> 00:29:00,120
MIS?

984
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:03,720
Ootake, meie oma radadega on ka probleem.

985
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:03,720
McLareni testimisrada. Seal on võimalik.

986
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:03,720
seal nad asju arendavad.

987
00:29:03,760 --> 00:29:08,200
Jah, ma tean.

988
00:29:03,760 --> 00:29:08,200
Ja seepärast, et ma seda tean.

989
00:29:03,760 --> 00:29:08,200
Ma tean ka, et nad ise ka seda teavad.

990
00:29:08,240 --> 00:29:10,640
