"Kurv on ees. Ole ettevaatlik."

1978
00:54:49,400 --> 00:54:52,720
sel korral, okei?

1979
00:54:54,480 --> 00:54:57,000
(rehvid hõikavad)

1980
00:54:57,040 --> 00:55:00,200
Ausalt öeldes,

1981
00:54:57,040 --> 00:55:00,200
Ma ei märganud.

1982
00:54:57,040 --> 00:55:00,200
Jamesi uus õnnetus.

1983
00:55:00,240 --> 00:55:04,520
...kuna ma olin selle juba varem märganud.

1984
00:55:00,240 --> 00:55:04,520
