1992
00:55:12,560 --> 00:55:15,200
-Nüüd on see tehtud.

1993
00:55:15,240 --> 00:55:19,120
Väga tore. Väga tore.

1994
00:55:15,240 --> 00:55:19,120
Mmm-mmm. Suits.

1995
